                    communications, see <ref target="#pg108">pp. 108</ref> ff. and <ref
                        target="#pg186">pp. 186</ref> ff.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d711-f3" n="28" xml:id="d711-f3-content">
                <p>Samuel de Souza Leão Gracie, Brazilian Ambassador In Chile.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
